\title{Direct Preference Optimization}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{dpo}
\tag{preference-optimization}

\p{Direct Preference Optimization rewrites a KL-regularized reward objective
as a policy loss on preference pairs. The derivation proceeds through an
optimal-policy identity, a reward--policy reparameterization, and a
Bradley--Terry comparison probability. Keeping those steps separate makes its
assumptions and its difference from reward-model PPO visible.}

